  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.1.0. Adds ModelBuilder.ApplyCqrsOutbox() and ApplyCqrsIdempotency() so OnModelCreating can apply the outbox / idempotency entity mappings in one call instead of constructing each IEntityTypeConfiguration by hand.",
